rogen's thermal Loop technology could be a GameChanger unlocking cheaper green hydrogen and unleashing demand across Industries check us out at new hydrogen. Comom for more info if successful thermol Loop would solidify the ambitious plans made by automakers governments and other stakeholders with the global green hydrogen Market projected to grow from \$1 billion dollar today to a reported \$30 billion by 2030 the opportunity for breakthrough Technologies like thermol Loop is huge in conclusion while</p><p>Green hydrogen has its challenges ongoing Partnerships and technological breakthroughs suggest a brighter future major automakers like BMW Toyota Hyundai and others are positioning themselves for a hydrogen powered future while regulatory pressures are driving demand for cleaner fuels with Innovations like thermal loop on the horizon we could see the cost barriers of green hydrogen fall opening a new wave of commercial opportunities thanks for tuning in to to this week's news commentary To learn more about new hydrogen and Our thermal Loop technology Visit us at new hydrogen. Thanks and we'll catch you again next week</p>"
