        "display" => true,
        'transcript' => "<p>Ring into a new air of motorport extreme H is set to redefine the thrill of racing with sustainability at its core while racing is loved worldwide it isn't exactly the most sustainable sport or it hasn't been until now if you haven't met let me introduce you to the most extraordinary world of extreme H which is the first ever hydrogen powerered off-road racing championship in less than two years extreme H will make history as the world's first</p><p>Hydrogen powered Motorsports series The FIA which is the governing body of Motorsport has officially recognized its potential and signed an agreement to give it full world championship status by 2026 that puts it in the same league as Formula 1 this ambitious move aims to leverage Motorsport as a testing ground for hydrogen technology organizers emphasized that the shift to hydrogen is more than a race it's about pushing the boundaries of Technology while Battery Technology has been at</p><p>The Forefront of Motorsport extreme H plans to make its Mark by exploring the untapped potential of hydrogen it's a bold move that could revolutionize the automotive industry new hydrogen is a promising pioneering force in the realm of cheap clean hydrogen production and can play a vital role in extreme AG's Mission are developing hydrogen Production Technologies could help to make extreme H and extreme Success New hydrogen's commitment to sustainability aligns perfectly with extreme H's vision for a</p><p>Cleaner Greener future of Motorsport like hydrogen fuel cell technology extreme H does have its doubters but much in the way that Formula E eventually found success extreme H is charting the course to advance hydrogen technology in a way that goes beyond boring applications to a sport with an Engaged and invested fan base hydrogen's potential is undeniable and extreme H seems ready to unlock it as they prepare for their debut season they're already attracting attention from automakers</p><p>Eager to explore and develop hydrogen technology while there are some risks involved organizers see extreme H as a unique opportunity to be the exclusive pure hydrogen championship for years to come it's a bold plan that could redefine the future of Motorsport and if you've listened this much you probably had better go visit new hydrogen. Comom sign up for our newsletter and you'll hear more about interesting and exciting applications for hydrogen and developments as they come forward</p><p>And If you like this bit about extreme H please drop us a comment and we'll do an update in the future I think this is a major boost for hydrogen it wasn't until Elon Musk made electric cars exciting that we started to see momentum and Battery development extreme H has the potential to combine the most abundant element in the universe hydrogen with racing technology it's an exciting application that promises a cleaner Greener and more powerful tomorrow at</p><p>The start of a new era of Motorsport we invite you to join us in celebrating extreme AG's Visionary Mission we definitely will be watching in I am Steve Hill thanks for your support and Thanks for watching</p>"
